<p data-start=3D"39" data-end=3D"387"><strong data-start=3D"39" data-end=3D=
"58">Deferred Values</strong> l=C3=A0 m=E1=BB=99t c=C6=A1 ch=E1=BA=BF trong=
 React gi=C3=BAp <strong data-start=3D"90" data-end=3D"134">gi=E1=BA=A3m th=
i=E1=BB=83u s=E1=BB=91 l=E1=BA=A7n render kh=C3=B4ng c=E1=BA=A7n thi=E1=BA=
=BFt</strong> trong tr=C6=B0=E1=BB=9Dng h=E1=BB=A3p c=C3=A1c gi=C3=A1 tr=E1=
=BB=8B thay =C4=91=E1=BB=95i li=C3=AAn t=E1=BB=A5c v=C3=A0 y=C3=AAu c=E1=BA=
=A7u t=C3=ADnh to=C3=A1n ph=E1=BB=A9c t=E1=BA=A1p. M=E1=BB=A5c ti=C3=AAu c=
=E1=BB=A7a Deferred Values l=C3=A0 <strong data-start=3D"245" data-end=3D"2=
69">tr=C3=AC ho=C3=A3n vi=E1=BB=87c render</strong> cho =C4=91=E1=BA=BFn kh=
i c=C3=A1c thay =C4=91=E1=BB=95i =E1=BB=95n =C4=91=E1=BB=8Bnh, gi=C3=BAp tr=
=C3=A1nh t=C3=ACnh tr=E1=BA=A1ng <strong data-start=3D"326" data-end=3D"334=
">jank</strong> (gi=E1=BA=ADt lag) v=C3=A0 t=E1=BB=91i =C6=B0u hi=E1=BB=87u=
 su=E1=BA=A5t giao di=E1=BB=87n ng=C6=B0=E1=BB=9Di d=C3=B9ng.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"389" data-end=3D"426"><strong data-start=3D"394" data-end=
=3D"426">T=E1=BA=A1i sao c=E1=BA=A7n Deferred Values?</strong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"427" data-end=3D"1052">
<li data-start=3D"427" data-end=3D"734">
<p data-start=3D"429" data-end=3D"734"><strong data-start=3D"429" data-end=
=3D"437">Jank</strong> l=C3=A0 hi=E1=BB=87n t=C6=B0=E1=BB=A3ng x=E1=BA=A3y =
ra khi giao di=E1=BB=87n ng=C6=B0=E1=BB=9Di d=C3=B9ng b=E1=BB=8B gi=E1=BA=
=ADt, lag do vi=E1=BB=87c render qu=C3=A1 nhi=E1=BB=81u l=E1=BA=A7n trong t=
h=E1=BB=9Di gian ng=E1=BA=AFn. =C4=90i=E1=BB=81u n=C3=A0y th=C6=B0=E1=BB=9D=
ng g=E1=BA=B7p khi gi=C3=A1 tr=E1=BB=8B c=E1=BB=A7a c=C3=A1c th=C3=A0nh ph=
