<h4 data-start=3D"1053" data-end=3D"1099"><strong data-start=3D"1058" data-=
end=3D"1099">C=C3=A1ch ho=E1=BA=A1t =C4=91=E1=BB=99ng c=E1=BB=A7a <code dat=
a-start=3D"1079" data-end=3D"1097">useDeferredValue</code></strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"1100" data-end=3D"1292"><code data-start=3D"1100" data-end=
=3D"1118">useDeferredValue</code> gi=C3=BAp <strong data-start=3D"1124" dat=
a-end=3D"1148">ho=C3=A3n l=E1=BA=A1i vi=E1=BB=87c render</strong> trong m=
=E1=BB=99t kho=E1=BA=A3ng th=E1=BB=9Di gian ng=E1=BA=AFn, cho ph=C3=A9p Rea=
ct l=C3=A0m vi=E1=BB=87c t=E1=BB=91t h=C6=A1n v=E1=BB=9Bi nh=E1=BB=AFng tha=
y =C4=91=E1=BB=95i kh=C3=B4ng quan tr=E1=BB=8Dng ho=E1=BA=B7c kh=C3=B4ng c=
=E1=BA=A7n ph=E1=BA=A3i ph=E1=BA=A3n h=E1=BB=93i ngay l=E1=BA=ADp t=E1=BB=
=A9c.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1294" data-end=3D"1586">Khi ng=C6=B0=E1=BB=9Di d=C3=B9ng t=
hay =C4=91=E1=BB=95i m=E1=BB=99t gi=C3=A1 tr=E1=BB=8B, React s=E1=BA=BD s=
=E1=BB=AD d=E1=BB=A5ng <strong data-start=3D"1348" data-end=3D"1367">React =
scheduler</strong> =C4=91=E1=BB=83 quy=E1=BA=BFt =C4=91=E1=BB=8Bnh khi n=C3=
=A0o th=E1=BB=B1c s=E1=BB=B1 c=E1=BA=A7n ph=E1=BA=A3i c=E1=BA=ADp nh=E1=BA=
=ADt l=E1=BA=A1i UI. N=E1=BA=BFu t=C3=A1c v=E1=BB=A5 render hi=E1=BB=87n t=
=E1=BA=A1i ch=C6=B0a ho=C3=A0n t=E1=BA=A5t, React s=E1=BA=BD ho=C3=A3n vi=
=E1=BB=87c render =C4=91=E1=BA=BFn khi c=C3=A1c thay =C4=91=E1=BB=95i =C4=
=91=C3=A3 =E1=BB=95n =C4=91=E1=BB=8Bnh, gi=E1=BA=A3m t=E1=BA=A3i cho tr=C3=
